# Script for camera_sensitivity_max.toml / camera_sensitivity_min.toml (see there).
100 pad connect
500 pad press start
700 pad press a
850 pad press a
1000 pad press down
1100 pad press a
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay pad press a
@gameplay+290 capture start
@gameplay+300 log mark start
@gameplay+330 look 100 0
@gameplay+360 log mark mouse_right
@gameplay+390 look 0 -40
@gameplay+420 log mark mouse_up
@gameplay+450 look 0 40
@gameplay+480 log mark level
@gameplay+490 pad axis rightx 16384
@gameplay+520 pad axis rightx 0
@gameplay+540 log mark stick_half
@gameplay+545 pad axis rightx 32767
@gameplay+553 pad axis rightx 0
@gameplay+565 log mark stick_right
@gameplay+570 log mark steady
@gameplay+571 look 10 0
@gameplay+572 look 10 0
@gameplay+573 look 10 0
@gameplay+574 look 10 0
@gameplay+575 look 10 0
@gameplay+576 look 10 0
@gameplay+577 look 10 0
@gameplay+578 look 10 0
@gameplay+579 look 10 0
@gameplay+580 look 10 0
@gameplay+581 look 10 0
@gameplay+582 look 10 0
@gameplay+583 look 10 0
@gameplay+584 look 10 0
@gameplay+585 look 10 0
@gameplay+586 log mark steady_mid
@gameplay+586 look 10 0
@gameplay+587 look 10 0
@gameplay+588 look 10 0
@gameplay+589 look 10 0
@gameplay+590 look 10 0
@gameplay+591 look 10 0
@gameplay+592 look 10 0
@gameplay+593 look 10 0
@gameplay+594 log mark steady_last
@gameplay+594 look 10 0
@gameplay+610 log mark steady_done
@gameplay+640 log mark end
